# The declared rate at a second point: rate 1/4 (log_blowup 2) over
# the analysis-only template, priced through the same rows the rate-1/2
# fixtures exercise. The deciders move with the declared rate — the
# eta-bar floor rises to ~1/148 and the threshold window collapses to
# (1/2, 3/4) — and two facts are new at this rate: the Johnson row
# derives for the first time (at rate 1/2 its dyadic sqrt-rho cap
# admits no positive delta), and the unique-decoding row refuses
# honestly (the corollary's last-round window is empty at this shape).
#
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: zkc-family %S/../Family/Inputs/friquarter.json --emit-vocabulary=%t/vocab.json --emit-spine=%t/spine.mlir
# RUN: zkc-seal %t/spine.mlir --protocol-vocabulary=%t/vocab.json \
# RUN:   --construction-profile-registry=%zkc-registry-dir/construction-profiles.json \
# RUN:   -o %t/sealed.artifacts > /dev/null
# RUN: %python %S/../SemanticClosure/lib/artifact_handoff.py stage %t/sealed.artifacts %t/sealed.mlirbc

