# The value-faithful mid instance: its anchor binding resolves — the
# same artifact the upstream judge grades — and the row then refuses at
# the body, because the opening rounds (zeta, alpha) are outside the
# FRI citation. Pricing them is the ALI/DEEP composition boundary
# recorded in evaluation/fri-bench/PRICING.md; the refusal names
# exactly what stands between this artifact and a priced judgment.
